3-Room Apartment – Fully Furnished & Move-In Ready**\n*Perfect for couples, small families, single parents or a shared flat*\n\nA bright, fully furnished 3-room apartment is available for rent. The apartment combines comfort, flexibility and a welcoming home-like atmosphere. It is move-in ready and ideal for anyone looking for a convenient and easy start.\n\n🛋 **Spacious Living Room**\nThe living room is comfortably furnished with a sofa bed, TV and dining table. It offers plenty of space for relaxing evenings, shared meals or working from home.\n\n🛏 **Quiet Bedroom with Double Bed**\nThe bedroom is designed as a calm and comfortable retreat, ideal for couples or anyone who values a separate and peaceful sleeping area.\n\n🔄 **Flexible Second Room**\nThe second room is currently furnished with a bed, wardrobe and desk. It can be used flexibly as a second bedroom, children’s room, guest room, home office or dressing room.\n\n🍳 **Fully Equipped Kitchen**\nThe kitchen includes a stove, oven, fridge, dishwasher and sufficient storage space. Everything needed for everyday living is already available.\n\n🌞 **Bright & Friendly Atmosphere**\nLarge windows provide plenty of natural light and create a pleasant living atmosphere.\n\n**Move in, settle in and feel at home.**\nThis apartment adapts easily to different living situations – whether for a couple, small family, single parent or shared flat.\n\n🚗 **Parking / Garage**\nA parking space or garage can be rented separately by arrangement.\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"shared"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"flooring":{"value":"laminat